his errand boy

4
00:00:24,892 --> 00:00:26,424
Hyeon-wu
I was at the store and…

5
00:00:26,507 --> 00:00:27,507
Hey

6
00:00:29,321 --> 00:00:30,469
Get lost
Don't talk to me

7
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,114
