over a joke?

25
00:01:30,092 --> 00:01:31,092
Lee Hyeon-wu

26
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:32,961
I need someone
to protect me!

27
00:01:34,667 --> 00:01:35,667
Hyeon-wu

28
00:01:37,369 --> 00:01:37,935
Do you…

29
00:01:38,383 --> 00:01:40,026
want to open this
with me?

30
00:01:43,373 --> 00:01:44,373
F***
